  "body": "We try to lock the whole user_ips table to do updates. This has two bad effects:\n* postgres keeps trying to start autovacuums which it then has to abort\n* when postgres finally gives up and does the autovacuum anyway, no user_ips updates happen until the vacuum completes, which can take several hours.",
